OpenPrinting Meeting

on the

Linux Foundation Japan Symposium

in the

Tokyo International Forum in Tokyo

on Friday, November 2, 2007, 10am - 5pm (Japanese local time)

See the agenda and the slides, and a link for directions to the 
Internatioal Forum on

https://www.linux-foundation.org/en/OpenPrinting/LFJapanSymposiumTokyo2007

If you cannot come to Tokyo in person, please make use of our call-in 
facility dialing the following phone number at any time during the meeting:

Phone: +1-712-451-6100
Access code: 243965#

Take into account the time differences between Japan and your country. 
The event happens 1am - 8am UTC and in the US you have to dial in in the 
afternoon of November 1.

I hope I will see (or at least hear) most of you on Friday.

